    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094450/extras/b798a757350b8cd13d9ee557cf6becab.webp?t=1733999222\" width=600 height=53 /></span><br><br>Join the Smoots characters in Smoots Summer Games II, the exciting sequel to Smoots Summer Games! With its charming cartoon style, this arcade game offers thrilling competitions for up to 4 players in local multiplayer. Test your skills in a variety of classic events such as the 100m dash, 400m hurdles, javelin throw, and pole vault, while also experiencing new challenges like cycling, archery, weight lifting, equestrian jumping, skeet shooting, canoeing, and climbing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094450/extras/45619893762cc74f24a88d72abfaf7ed.avif?t=1733999222\" width=600 height=220 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><strong>Local Multiplayer:</strong> Compete with up to 4 players in local games.<br><strong>Variety of Events:</strong> Classic and new sports including:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Track &amp; Field: 100m dash, 400m dash, 110m hurdles, 400m hurdles<br></li><li>Throws: Javelin throw, hammer throw<br></li><li>Jumps: Long jump, high jump, pole vault<br></li><li>Swimming: Breaststroke, backstroke</li></ul><strong>New Events:</strong> Cycling, archery, weight lifting, equestrian jumping, skeet shooting, canoeing, climbing<br><strong>Game Modes:</strong> Practice, Championship, Special Challenge, and Battle Royale for diverse gameplay experiences.<br><strong>Cartoon Style:</strong> Enjoy the unique and fun cartoon-style graphics that add charm and personality to each event.<br><br>Engage in multiple game modes including Practice, Championship, Special Challenge, and the intense Battle Royale. Smoots Summer Games II delivers endless fun and competition for all ages!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094450/extras/020892b66bf7c210fc5bcecea8156d70.webp?t=1733999222\" width=600 height=53 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094450/extras/b798a757350b8cd13d9ee557cf6becab.webp?t=1733999222\" width=600 height=53 /></span><br><br>Join the Smoots characters in Smoots Summer Games II, the exciting sequel to Smoots Summer Games! With its charming cartoon style, this arcade game offers thrilling competitions for up to 4 players in local multiplayer. Test your skills in a variety of classic events such as the 100m dash, 400m hurdles, javelin throw, and pole vault, while also experiencing new challenges like cycling, archery, weight lifting, equestrian jumping, skeet shooting, canoeing, and climbing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094450/extras/45619893762cc74f24a88d72abfaf7ed.avif?t=1733999222\" width=600 height=220 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><strong>Local Multiplayer:</strong> Compete with up to 4 players in local games.<br><strong>Variety of Events:</strong> Classic and new sports including:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Track &amp; Field: 100m dash, 400m dash, 110m hurdles, 400m hurdles<br></li><li>Throws: Javelin throw, hammer throw<br></li><li>Jumps: Long jump, high jump, pole vault<br></li><li>Swimming: Breaststroke, backstroke</li></ul><strong>New Events:</strong> Cycling, archery, weight lifting, equestrian jumping, skeet shooting, canoeing, climbing<br><strong>Game Modes:</strong> Practice, Championship, Special Challenge, and Battle Royale for diverse gameplay experiences.<br><strong>Cartoon Style:</strong> Enjoy the unique and fun cartoon-style graphics that add charm and personality to each event.<br><br>Engage in multiple game modes including Practice, Championship, Special Challenge, and the intense Battle Royale. Smoots Summer Games II delivers endless fun and competition for all ages!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094450/extras/020892b66bf7c210fc5bcecea8156d70.webp?t=1733999222\" width=600 height=53 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Compete with up to 4 players in Smoots Summer Games II, the cartoon-styled arcade sequel. Enjoy classic and new events like the 100m dash, swimming, cycling, archery, and more. Master game modes including Practice, Championship, Special Challenge, and Battle Royale.",
